            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI am not sure how this can be resolved in 'mini.nvim' docs themselves. All demo videos are recorded as mp4 video files with H.264 codec, which is [recommended by GitHub itself](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/working-with-advanced-formatting/attaching-files). So I am afraid, it is something to do with the MacOS/Safari setup, as I had it verified as playable as expected on some other MacOS/Safair setup (not mine).\n\nClosing as nothing much can be done on 'mini.nvim' side.\n\n---\n\nI'll also mention #1287 for reference.",
